"entity": {
"name": "Noba Bank Group AB",
"description": "NOBA Bank Group AB is a Europes specialist bank company offering private loans, credit cards, mortgages, equity release mortgages, and savings accounts to individuals under three brands: Nordax Bank, Bank Norwegian, and Svensk Hypotekspension. The firm has a broad range of products in four Nordic countries and offers credit cards and savings in Germany, as well as savings products in Spain, the Netherlands, and Ireland. The company was founded by Odd Morten Falch and Mats Lagerqvist in 2003 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.",
